Adding a method to INoiseConstTool to return both RMS/offset.

We usually retrieve from INoiseConstTool both the RMS and offset
for a given cell.  It is thus more efficient to have a single method
to return both, so we only need to the cell lookup onces.

This is the first step, adding the new method to TopoCaloNoisyCells.
